# Copy this to devices.local and fill in your values.
# devices.local is gitignored — never push real UDIDs or team IDs.
#
# How to find UDID:
#   - Connect device via USB
#   - Xcode → Window → Devices and Simulators
#   - Or: system_profiler SPUSBDataType | grep -A 11 "iPhone\|iPad"
#
# Development team (Apple Developer team ID for signing):
#   - Find yours: security find-identity -v -p codesigning 2>/dev/null | grep -o '[A-Z0-9]\{10\}'
#   - Or check Xcode → Signing & Capabilities → Team
#   - Leave blank to use automatic signing (requires Xcode logged into Apple ID)
#
# Leave UDIDs blank to skip device install (simulators will open instead).

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=""
IPHONE_UDID=""
IPAD_UDID=""